  "meta": {"motion": "static", "death": {"kind": "structure", "ticks": 7}, "doc": "Factory (3x3): olive hall with a roll-up door (10 DOOR slats) on the south face, skylight roof, gantry crane, extractor fan (RADAR part), stacks."},
